<figure class="research-figure jlens-pipeline">
  <div class="research-figure__header">
    <span class="figure-kicker">J-lens pipeline</span>
    <strong>Fit once, then reuse the lens</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="pipeline-phase">
    <div class="phase-label">
      <span>Phase 1</span>
      <strong>Fit once per model</strong>
      <small>Offline preparation</small>
    </div>
    <div class="phase-flow">
      <div class="diagram-node is-input">
        <span class="node-step">01</span>
        <strong>Prompt corpus</strong>
        <code>1,000 × 128 tokens</code>
        <small>Many ordinary contexts</small>
      </div>
      <span class="diagram-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="diagram-node is-process">
        <span class="node-step">02</span>
        <strong>Average Jacobians</strong>
        <code>E[∂h_target / ∂h_l]</code>
        <small>Across prompts and positions</small>
      </div>
      <span class="diagram-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="diagram-node is-output">
        <span class="node-step">03</span>
        <strong>Layer lens</strong>
        <code>J_l</code>
        <small>One matrix for each layer</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="phase-divider" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>reuse J_l</span>
  </div>

  <div class="pipeline-phase">
    <div class="phase-label">
      <span>Phase 2</span>
      <strong>Read many activations</strong>
      <small>Per prompt inference</small>
    </div>
    <div class="phase-flow is-four-step">
      <div class="diagram-node is-input">
        <span class="node-step">01</span>
        <strong>Hidden state</strong>
        <code>h_l,t</code>
        <small>One layer and position</small>
      </div>
      <span class="diagram-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="diagram-node is-process">
        <span class="node-step">02</span>
        <strong>Transport</strong>
        <code>J_l h_l,t</code>
        <small>Map toward output geometry</small>
      </div>
      <span class="diagram-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="diagram-node is-process">
        <span class="node-step">03</span>
        <strong>Norm + unembed</strong>
        <code>W_U norm(·)</code>
        <small>Score the vocabulary</small>
      </div>
      <span class="diagram-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="token-output" aria-label="Example ranked token readout">
        <span class="node-step">04</span>
        <strong>Ranked readout</strong>
        <ol>
          <li><span>spider</span><b>1</b></li>
          <li><span>web</span><b>2</b></li>
          <li><span>eight</span><b>3</b></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    Fitting estimates a context-averaged transport matrix. Readout applies that
    fixed matrix to a new hidden state and returns vocabulary scores. The token
    list is an interpretation interface, not a transcript of literal inner speech.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

